# The launcher stages only Git-indexed/unignored public source. Keep this
# independent allowlist as a second boundary for direct Docker builds.
**
!skills/
!skills/**
!docs/
!docs/**
!examples/
!examples/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**
!tests/
!tests/**
!.github/
!.github/**
!AGENTS.md
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
!.gitignore
!.markdownlint-cli2.jsonc
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!requirements-dev.txt
!requirements-agent-ci.txt
!ruff.toml
**/.git
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.ruff_cache
**/.codex
**/.agents
**/.claude
**/.aws
**/.ssh
**/.env*
